rc=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the courtesy light\nis undamaged.</p><p>If the bulb was removed, refit in its socket.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the courtesy light.</p><p>Check that the bulb is working.</p>"]]